  "description": "Migrated from purpose: TICKET_CONFIRMED",
  "subject": "🎫 Vé điện tử TEDx - Đơn hàng {{orderNumber}}",
  "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Vé điện tử TEDxFPTUniversityHCMC</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background-color: #050505;\n      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n      .container {\n        width: 100% !important;\n        padding-left: 10px !important;\n        padding-right: 10px !important;\n      }\n      .ticket-body {\n        padding: 20px !important;\n      }\n      .cta-btn {\n        display: block !important;\n        width: 100% !important;\n        margin-right: 0 !important;\n        margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n        padding: 15px 0 !important;\n        text-align: center !important;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #050505; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #050505;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 40px 10px;\">\n        \n        <table class=\"container\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 600px; width: 100%;\">\n          <!-- Top Accent -->\n          <tr>\n            <td height=\"6\" style=\"background-color: #e62b1e; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\"></td>\n          </tr>\n          \n          <!-- Logo Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #111111; padding: 32px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #222222;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -1px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n                    TED<span style=\"color: #e62b1e; font-weight: 300;\">x</span>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #888888; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; padding-top: 4px; text-align: center;\">\n                    FPT University HCMC\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Hero Greeting -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #111111; padding: 32px 32px 16px 32px; text-align: left;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.3;\">\n                Xin chào / Hello, <span style=\"color: #e62b1e;\">{{customerName}}</span>\n              </h1>\n              <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #aaaaaa; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                Cảm ơn bạn đã đồng hành cùng TEDxFPTUniversityHCMC 2026. Đơn hàng <strong style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: monospace;\">#{{orderNumber}}</strong> của bạn đã thanh toán thành công. Dưới đây là thông tin vé điện tử của bạn:\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- The Ticket Card Container -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #111111; padding: 16px 32px 32px 32px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #2d2d2d; overflow: hidden;\">\n                \n                <!-- Ticket Header Banner -->\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e62b1e 0%, #b91c14 100%); background-color: #e62b1e; padding: 16px 24px;\">\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td>\n                          <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n                            VÉ VÀO CỬA / ENTRY TICKET\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td align=\"right\">\n                          <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); font-family: monospace;\">\n                            #{{orderNumber}}\n                          </span>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- Ticket Content -->\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"ticket-body\" style=\"padding: 24px 24px 16px 24px; text-align: left;\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Event Title -->\n                    <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 1.4;\">\n                      {{eventName}}\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <!-- Details Grid -->\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #777777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">Ngày / Date</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;\">{{eventDate}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #777777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">Giờ / Time</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;\">{{eventTime}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-bottom: 16px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #777777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">Địa điểm / Venue</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.4;\">{{eventVenue}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 8px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #777777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">Vị trí ghế / Seat(s)</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #e62b1e;\">{{seats}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 8px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #777777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700;\">Tổng tiền / Total Amount</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff;\">{{totalAmount}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- Perforated Line -->\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 0 24px;\">\n                    <div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #3a3a3a; height: 1px; line-height: 1px; font-size: 1px;\">&nbsp;</div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- QR Section - one card per ticket: type, TKT- check-in\n                     code, price and its own QR. Each recipient receives only\n                     the tickets addressed to them. Falls back to the\n                     order-level QR for orders with no per-ticket codes.\n                     NOTE: variables are substituted by plain string replace,\n                     so never name one inside a comment - it expands here too. -->\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 24px; text-align: center; background-color: #1c1c1c;\">\n                    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #aaaaaa; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n                      MÃ QR CHECK-IN / CHECK-IN QR CODE\n                    </p>\n\n                    {{ticketUnitsHtml}}\n\n                    <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 340px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n                      Mỗi vé có một mã QR riêng và chỉ check-in được <strong style=\"color: #ffffff;\">1 lần</strong>. Vui lòng xuất trình mã QR tương ứng tại cổng sự kiện.<br/>Each QR admits one person, once. Do not share these codes with anyone.\n                    </p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Action Buttons (CTA) -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #111111; padding: 0 32px 32px 32px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\">\n                    <a class=\"cta-btn\" href=\"{{ticketUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #e62b1e; color: #ffffff; padding: 16px 36px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #e62b1e; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(230, 43, 30, 0.3);\">\n                      🎫 Xem Vé Online / View Online\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Event Information / Notes -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #111111; padding: 0 32px 32px 32px;\">\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #161616; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #e62b1e;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px; text-align: left;\">\n                    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n                      LƯU Ý QUAN TRỌNG / IMPORTANT NOTES\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #999999; line-height: 1.8;\">\n                      <li>Có mặt trước giờ bắt đầu ít nhất 30 phút để ổn định vị trí. / Please arrive at least 30 minutes before the start time.</li>\n                      <li>Vé điện tử chỉ có giá trị check-in một lần tương ứng với số ghế đã mua. / Each QR code is valid for single check-in matching your seat count.</li>\n                      <li>Vui lòng mang theo CCCD/CMND để xác minh nếu cần. / Please bring your ID card for verification if requested.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #050505; padding: 40px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #111111;\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #555555; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n                Cần hỗ trợ? / Need help?\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px;\">\n                <a href=\"mailto:support@tedxfptuhcm.com\" style=\"color: #e62b1e; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\">\n                  support@tedxfptuhcm.com\n                </a>\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 24px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                Email này được gửi tự động từ hệ thống TEDxFPTUniversityHCMC.<br/>\n                © 2026 TEDxFPTUniversityHCMC. All rights reserved.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
